&lt;li&gt;[Tracer] Update the TagsList infrastructure to store &lt;code&gt;int&lt;/code&gt; properties on ITags implementations (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4973062075" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/8941" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8941/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8941"&gt;#8941&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[OTLP] Exclude non-top-level, non-measured spans from OTLP trace metrics (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4988906381" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/8947" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8947/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8947"&gt;#8947&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
