&lt;li&gt;[Tracer] Distinguish full and locked trace buffers (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5048592367" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/8980" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8980/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8980"&gt;#8980&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
